{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12167","headline":"罢章陵令山居过中峰道者二首 二 · 钱起","name":"罢章陵令山居过中峰道者二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丘壑趣如此，暮年始栖偃。\n赖遇无心云，不笑归来晚。\n鸣鸠拂红枝，初服傍清畎。\n昨日山僧来，犹嫌嘉遯浅。\n托君紫阳家，路灭心更远。\n梯云创其居，抱犊上绝巘。\n杏田溪一曲，霞境峰几转。\n路石挂飞泉，谢公应在眼。\n愿言携手去，采药长不返。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12167.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12167","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}